{"id": "34421", "title": "老婆爱闯祸", "author": "辰晞", "category": "文学名著", "count": 39, "available": 0, "cover": "", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/34/34421.htm", "intro": "这小女人可真是会伤他的心啊！这么多年来，他始终在她身边守护她，他的身边也只有她一个女人，但这小妮子傻呼呼的，不但对他的感情视而不见，更令他吐血的是，她竟然还误会他喜欢男人！？而理由竟然是——她每天跟在他旁边，却从没见过哪个女人跟著他！？“那你就再每天跟著我，看看我身边的那个女人到底是谁。”“好，那我就继续跟著你，看你身边的女人到底是谁！” 嘿嘿，他就等她这句话了！他绝对会让她好好看看“那个女人”是谁的——", "base": "files/article/html/34/34421", "chapters": [{"title": "楔子", "file": "2185205.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第1页", "file": "2185206.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第2页", "file": "2185207.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第3页", "file": "2185208.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第4页", "file": "2185209.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第5页", "file": "2185210.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第6页", "file": "2185211.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第7页", "file": "2185212.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第8页", "file": "2185213.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第9页", "file": "2185214.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第10页", "file": "2185215.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第11页", "file": "2185216.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第12页", "file": "2185217.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第13页", "file": "2185218.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第14页", "file": "2185219.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第15页", "file": "2185220.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第16页", "file": "2185221.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第17页", "file": "2185222.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第18页", "file": "2185223.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第19页", "file": "2185224.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第20页", "file": "2185225.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第21页", "file": "2185226.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第22页", "file": "2185227.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第23页", "file": "2185228.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第24页", "file": "2185229.html", "available": f